{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01645",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 5.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.73,
      "end_seconds": 11.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "Thanks. Hello, come in, sit down. What brings you in today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.13,
      "end_seconds": 19.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "It's double vision, mostly. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.67,
      "end_seconds": 25.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.82,
      "end_seconds": 29.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "For about three months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.76,
      "end_seconds": 34.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Right, any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.45,
      "end_seconds": 46.87,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a swollen red eyelid as well. The swollen red eyelid? That's been for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.46,
      "end_seconds": 53.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.17,
      "end_seconds": 63.62,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "I'd say every other day. I did have a fever at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.45,
      "end_seconds": 68.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "And what about sinus infection or recent injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.36,
      "end_seconds": 72.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.5,
      "end_seconds": 75.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.5,
      "end_seconds": 78.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.15,
      "end_seconds": 82.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.27,
      "end_seconds": 84.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.71,
      "end_seconds": 90.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Right, are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.03,
      "end_seconds": 95.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.72,
      "end_seconds": 97.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.64,
      "end_seconds": 106.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "So, you know, I have COPD, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.87,
      "end_seconds": 109.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Okay, anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.34,
      "end_seconds": 111.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Yes, thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.04,
      "end_seconds": 124.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.45,
      "end_seconds": 136.87,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I work in accounts at a hospital. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.3,
      "end_seconds": 143.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please. I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.38,
      "end_seconds": 150.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Yeah, it's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.0,
      "end_seconds": 151.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.77,
      "end_seconds": 159.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Alendronate. I take it 70 milligrams, once a week for my bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 161.36,
      "end_seconds": 166.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 35 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.16,
      "end_seconds": 172.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.66,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.43,
      "end_seconds": 176.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Well, no, I left it at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 179.89,
      "end_seconds": 186.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Blood pressure 119 over 71, temperature 38.1, pulse 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.96,
      "end_seconds": 189.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.22,
      "end_seconds": 193.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.33,
      "end_seconds": 211.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.74,
      "end_seconds": 215.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.26,
      "end_seconds": 238.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "The eyelid is swollen shut, the eye is bulging and the movements are painful and limited."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.19,
      "end_seconds": 245.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.94,
      "end_seconds": 267.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, my working impression is orbital cellulitis. Periorbital cellulitis is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.95,
      "end_seconds": 272.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Is this serious, you know, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.37,
      "end_seconds": 298.45,
      "duration_seconds": 25.08,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with orbital cellulitis do well once it's treated properly. I'm sending you for an urgent CT scan because of orbital cellulitis. I'm sending you for blood tests because of orbital cellulitis. You need admission today for intravenous antibiotics. I'd like you to see the eye team as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.32,
      "end_seconds": 309.19,
      "duration_seconds": 8.87,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.87,
      "end_seconds": 311.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.84,
      "end_seconds": 325.27,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Let's plan a check straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.09,
      "end_seconds": 328.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.29,
      "end_seconds": 332.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.25,
      "end_seconds": 337.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.45,
      "end_seconds": 339.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}